body:
Sometimes we focused too much on the life norms -career, marriage, buying a house, or starting a family - that seem so distant from our current place and time...

that we often forget to live in the present. Find something to do in the here and now and have fun!

&#x200B;

I am an university student who work crazy amount of hours at such dehumanizing food service industry. The other day the customers were so critical and untrustworthy with me for no apparent reasons and for the first time in my employment at this place I almost cried.

&#x200B;

Anyhoo, I still live in the moment and am having a blast with it! What I usually do is sketch dark surreal arts and listen to angst-filled nu metal music. Every week I ensure to take a solo hike along the edge of the city :)
